message: "If you use UrbanStreetVQA, please cite it as below."
title: "UrbanStreetVQA: A Benchmark for Visual Understanding of Urban Street Views"
abstract: >-
  UrbanStreetVQA is a visual-question-answering benchmark built from
  pedestrian-viewpoint imagery of real-world urban streets, evaluating visual
  perception and camera- and object-centric spatial reasoning.
